Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.19,0:02:29.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.48,0:02:34.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚过五点半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just past 5:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:37.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.72,0:03:02.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚没看见那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't see that last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.00,0:03:05.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没看见什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't see what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.47,0:03:13.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还在走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.64,0:03:17.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但看起来像是队尾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like the end of them, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.84,0:03:20.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走了一夜啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All damn night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.93,0:03:22.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少尼根够聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least Negan's smart enough
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.08,0:03:24.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没让那些东西接近我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to let that mess anywhere near us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.05,0:03:27.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肥乔至少还是有点用处的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fat Joey's good for something, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.85,0:03:29.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是说他很能吃蛋糕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, eating cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.84,0:03:32.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他负责给尸群改道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He rigged the herdway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.58,0:03:33.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是转转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trips.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.00,0:03:35.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么大不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.80,0:03:37.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像游击队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guerilla kind of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:40.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:43.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战争中的游击队  白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in warfare, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.56,0:03:46.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上个月搜刮拿到的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those demo sticks from that run last month,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.31,0:03:48.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新人那里拿到的火箭筒\N{\fnArial\fs30}the RPGs from the new guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.33,0:03:51.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许能削减数量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it takes it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.89,0:03:53.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除掉它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.53,0:03:57.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  很少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, it's a trickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.62,0:03:59.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们走  -终于\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. - Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.25,0:04:01.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.52,0:05:05.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做记号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making a trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.72,0:05:08.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们接近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.60,0:05:19.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该下车了  剩下的路跟着走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should bail out, follow the rest of the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:20.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看能看见什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}see what we can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.98,0:05:22.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:23.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.11,0:05:26.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一般摔不会受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't usually the fall that gets us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.64,0:05:29.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抵抗才会受伤  顺势滚滚就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's trying to fight it. Run with it or roll with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:31.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡车速度够慢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truck's going slow enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.75,0:05:32.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会在盲区\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be in the blind spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.58,0:05:33.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以跟着别的车过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can race behind one of the other cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.67,0:05:35.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我搞砸了  我们被抓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-If -- If I screw up and we get caught --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.10,0:05:37.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会没事的  我们现在得下车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be fine. We just got to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:40.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  先给我演示一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Show me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.63,0:06:00.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"先给我演示一下"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Show me first"...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.05,0:06:28.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  小伙子们  卸货  搬进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, boys, let's get this haul unloaded and inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:31.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要回去了  自己泻点火\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to get back in there and unload a little myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.00,0:06:33.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根  得跟你谈谈改道的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan, need to talk to you about redirect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.25,0:06:35.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,改道怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the redirect?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.54,0:06:36.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It got screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.61,0:06:38.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在在处理  但外面一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on it now, but it's a mess out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.41,0:06:40.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是谁的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whose job was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.46,0:06:41.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个背包和一个帐篷\N{\fnArial\fs30}...A pack and a tent...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.22,0:06:43.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.81,0:06:45.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为他们装得满满的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought they packed this up tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.64,0:06:46.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.75,0:06:48.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还会送更多来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plenty more where this came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.14,0:06:48.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.40,0:06:54.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.97,0:06:56.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.66,0:07:02.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后退  放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back! Drop your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.20,0:07:07.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想要尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only want Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.25,0:07:09.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他杀了我的朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.58,0:07:11.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别人没必要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one else needs to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.88,0:07:20.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.56,0:07:27.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.41,0:07:32.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你选了这把枪是因为它看起来很酷吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you pick that gun 'cause it looks cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.97,0:07:34.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对是  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You totally did, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.16,0:07:38.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子  我不会撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, I ain't gonna lie --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.13,0:07:41.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吓死老子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you scare the shit outta me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.19,0:07:47.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.92,0:07:49.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dwight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.12,0:07:52.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.49,0:08:04.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是对待新客人的方式吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that any way to treat our new guest?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.81,0:08:07.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.46,0:08:10.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我带你四处转转\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will show you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.58,0:09:28.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.68,0:09:34.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.06,0:09:36.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我带你四处转转\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll show you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.09,0:09:41.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟你爸爸一样  都有令人讨厌的眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you do the same damn stink-eye as your dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.51,0:09:44.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过只有一半讨厌  因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}except it's only half as good 'cause...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.39,0:09:46.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的  你\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, you know, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.22,0:09:47.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少了只眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}missing an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.16,0:09:51.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.85,0:09:55.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的不拉我的手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're really not gonna take my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.51,0:09:58.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你还有手是你走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you're lucky you even still have a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.51,0:10:02.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的伙伴达里尔也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same as your boy Daryl over here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:04.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}now that I think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.88,0:10:06.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,工作怎么样  达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the job going, Daryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.42,0:10:08.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对你来说够劲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:11.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  一只手会很难工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it'd be tough with one arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.45,0:10:22.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聪明的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, smart kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.95,0:10:24.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.32,0:10:27.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,德怀特  你带上达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dwighty-boy, why don't you grab Daryl,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:30.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去厨房  准备点吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}take him to the kitchen, do a little grub prep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.39,0:10:32.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新计划  伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}New plan, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.22,0:10:34.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死人烧了  晚点再卸货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's burn the dead, unload the truck later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.09,0:10:36.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  我今天都没时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, I am not gonna have time
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.92,0:10:39.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干我的老婆们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to screw any of my wives today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.72,0:10:43.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许有时间干一个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, maybe one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.22,0:10:48.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.89,0:10:51.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要对我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.52,0:11:00.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number one,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.43,0:11:03.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别打破我对你的印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}do not shatter my image of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.99,0:11:05.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个硬汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a badass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.38,0:11:06.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天不怕地不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not scared of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.54,0:11:07.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别怕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be scared of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.34,0:11:08.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这令人失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.31,0:11:10.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number two...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:14.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真想让我毁掉惊喜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you really want me to ruin the surprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.23,0:11:17.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.86,0:11:19.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.91,0:11:22.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.68,0:11:31.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(关门前一定要进行夜间检查)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.07,0:11:37.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:52.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救世军去外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors have gone out into the world
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.76,0:11:54.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与行尸斗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}and fought the dead
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.22,0:11:58.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带回来了一些很好的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and come back with some really good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.34,0:12:01.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们努力工作  遵守规定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of that stuff can be yours
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:06.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些东西可以归你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you work hard and play by the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.17,0:12:13.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天  每个人晚餐都能吃到新鲜蔬菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, everybody gets fresh vegetables at dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.16,0:12:15.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不需要工分\N{\fnArial\fs30}No points needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.64,0:12:21.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.85,0:12:24.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尊重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.87,0:12:27.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很酷吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.40,0:12:30.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还跪着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They still on their knees?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.41,0:12:32.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还原\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you were!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.42,0:12:41.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想给你看一些我打了B+\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I wanted to show you a few potentials
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.34,0:12:43.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是更高分数的潜力地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've rated B-plus or higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.04,0:12:44.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我们要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.59,0:12:46.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我感到你十分确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}While I'm picking up a high level of certainty,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.63,0:12:48.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但为了不疏忽  我还是要提到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be remiss if I didn't mention
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.06,0:12:50.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在对周边区域的深入分析后\N{\fnArial\fs30}that after a thorough analysis of the grid,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.41,0:12:52.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打叉了所有我们搜寻过的地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}X'ing out any places we've already combed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.51,0:12:53.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信我准确定位了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do believe I've bull's-eye'd
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.74,0:12:56.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一些值得考虑的地点  来进行手头的特定任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}some worth considering for the specific task at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.43,0:12:57.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:00.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为尼根找东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finding goods for Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.80,0:13:02.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们才不为那混蛋做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're not doing shit for that cabron.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.31,0:13:08.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要出去为救世军找东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going out to find stuff for the Saviors?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.31,0:13:11.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.75,0:13:15.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么好抵抗的  罗西塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no fighting it, Rosita.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.12,0:13:18.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们该一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps we should all travel together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.03,0:13:19.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.70,0:13:23.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四个人在大海里更容易捞针\N{\fnArial\fs30}We come across a haystack, four POVs could draw out whatever we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.64,0:13:24.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们自己可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're fine on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.89,0:13:27.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you don't like it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.28,0:13:28.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不想听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you don't want to hear it from me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:30.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们得为他们找东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we got to produce for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.37,0:13:32.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就像是交税\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is like taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.59,0:13:34.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-喂  -过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.83,0:13:35.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.63,0:13:38.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以一直对我生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can keep acting pissed at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.77,0:13:40.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这不是我做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I didn't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.58,0:13:41.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.93,0:13:45.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得你可以做得更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.30,0:13:47.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.71,0:13:49.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.76,0:13:53.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定给自己藏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I bet you already have a whole truck-load full of stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.48,0:13:55.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一卡车东西  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}hidden out there for yourself, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.72,0:13:57.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去拿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.24,0:14:01.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去交税  别他妈来烦我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pay your taxes, and leave me the hell alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.18,0:14:05.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.68,0:14:22.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.48,0:14:25.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别管这孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mind the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.12,0:14:30.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.19,0:14:32.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你来的地方  每个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every woman where you're from
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:35.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿得都像是汽修店里的会计\N{\fnArial\fs30}dresses like they do the books at an auto shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.57,0:14:37.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会想看看她们的乳头的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna want to look at their titties.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.09,0:14:40.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  我不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cool. I won't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.80,0:14:43.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们不介意  你自便\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't mind. Knock yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.34,0:14:53.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能和你谈谈吗  爱妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I talk to you for a minute, dear wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:00.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用拘束  小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make yourself comfortable, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.99,0:15:24.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安珀和马克怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened with Amber and Mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.40,0:15:26.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不在这里时我们所谈论的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we talk about when you're not here
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.28,0:15:28.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}is none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:31.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair play.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.79,0:15:40.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我听说了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to know what I heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.62,0:15:45.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说马克翘掉了改道的班\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard that Mark skipped out on redirect duty
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.72,0:15:47.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就为了和安珀幽会\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be with Amber.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.38,0:15:50.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得知道这是不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know if it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.74,0:15:59.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我立规矩是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are rules for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.88,0:16:02.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人要是死了什么都是一场空\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing matters if you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.45,0:16:08.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  你在这里是因为你懂这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, my dear, are here because you get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.66,0:16:17.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她只是犯了个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}She made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.31,0:16:19.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别难为她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go easy on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.61,0:16:21.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm the hell down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.51,0:16:29.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打过你们中的任何一个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ever hit one of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.67,0:16:31.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.06,0:16:34.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.41,0:16:36.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有更可怕的手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.06,0:16:49.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.44,0:16:56.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be continued.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:30.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安珀  宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amber, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.79,0:17:33.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我不希望这里有人是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I don't want anyone here
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.89,0:17:35.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不情不愿地留下的  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that doesn't want to be here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.90,0:17:41.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如你想离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you want to leave
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:43.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到马克身边...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and go back to Mark...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.97,0:17:45.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.77,0:17:48.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你知道什么事是不可以做的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what can't you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.51,0:17:52.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背着你乱搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheat on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.24,0:17:55.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.90,0:17:57.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.25,0:18:01.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背着我乱搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}cheat on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.52,0:18:09.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有大把妞儿想取代你的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's plenty of other gals who would love to take your place,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.01,0:18:12.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也能想到几个适合你做的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's a few job openings that I can think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.83,0:18:16.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想回到马克和你妈妈身边吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to go back to Mark and your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.52,0:18:20.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以安排你们三个做同一个工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I'll put you all on the same job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.01,0:18:21.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.13,0:18:23.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.19,0:18:24.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会留下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.35,0:18:26.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm...I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.95,0:18:30.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道那意味着什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what that means, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.22,0:18:35.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道那意味着什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what that means, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.01,0:18:40.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知...道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ye-- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.80,0:18:44.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你  尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.19,0:18:48.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当然爱我了  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, of course you do, darlin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.45,0:18:53.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你在哭什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why you're crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.52,0:18:57.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会过得舒舒服服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all gonna work out aces for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.14,0:19:24.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能去帮我把卡森喊来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you get Carson for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:29.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好的  -你刚刚看见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.69,0:19:30.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没为难她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't hard on her,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.98,0:19:35.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即便我...总体来说不是个好说话的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}even though I am... very hard in general.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.99,0:19:37.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.10,0:19:38.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.73,0:19:42.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但诡异的是  你依然喜欢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the messed-up thing is, you like me anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.32,0:19:46.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道真相的  和我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the truth, just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.17,0:20:30.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔  你能帮我端着这个盘子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, will you grab this tray for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.39,0:20:38.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么把他带来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you got him here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.49,0:20:43.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不在这里时我们所谈论的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we talk about when you're not here...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.96,0:20:46.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}is none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.45,0:20:55.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别逼我把这根牙签\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not make me put this toothpick
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.17,0:20:58.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,插进他仅剩的那只眼睛里\N{\fnArial\fs30}through the only eye he has.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.65,0:21:00.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟德怀特走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go with Dwight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.55,0:21:03.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会给你找个拖把\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll get you a mop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.47,0:21:04.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小德怀特...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dwighty boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.35,0:21:07.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把炉子生起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}fire up that furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.78,0:21:09.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一会儿就下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be down in a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.34,0:21:11.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是时候往日重现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for a little deja vu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.27,0:21:14.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.41,0:21:52.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只有今天一天的时间搜寻物资了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have today and only today to find somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.46,0:21:55.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们可能明天就回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could be back by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.73,0:21:57.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也可能现在就回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.21,0:22:11.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(继续向前走  等着你的只有麻烦)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.09,0:22:26.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恨某个人...这算是罪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hating somebody -- is that a sin?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.43,0:22:29.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.63,0:22:32.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不一定算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.29,0:22:35.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想法只是想法而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thoughts are just thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.59,0:22:37.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重要的是我们的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our actions that matter in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.31,0:22:49.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我恨瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.66,0:22:54.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他曾经是个警察  那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a cop. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.45,0:22:56.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不该他管事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He shouldn't be in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.81,0:23:01.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我母亲  她...是国会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother, she -- she served in Congress.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.00,0:23:02.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她领导人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She led people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.38,0:23:04.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她能发掘人们的闪光点\N{\fnArial\fs30}She brought out the good in people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.32,0:23:06.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克发掘了我的闪光点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick brought out the good in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.92,0:23:10.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么发掘的  靠欺负你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How? By bullying you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.29,0:23:15.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.84,0:23:19.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但主要还是靠启发我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But mostly by inspiring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.93,0:23:22.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不仅仅是保住了大家的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't just keep people alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.49,0:23:24.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还让我们团结在了一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}He brought us all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.29,0:23:28.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不完美  但他是个有主见的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not perfect, but he's a man who finds his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.20,0:23:31.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可没有保住所有人的命  加百利\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't keep everybody alive, Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.45,0:23:33.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我母亲  我父亲  我兄弟...\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother, my father, my brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.56,0:23:35.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是他的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't his fault.
