Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.61,0:34:18.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你亲眼目睹了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see it happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.13,0:34:21.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开枪打死了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shot her...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.59,0:34:25.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在转化之前...\N{\fnArial\fs30}before it could...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.57,0:34:32.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠  难怪你是个成长中的小连环杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, no wonder you're a little serial killer in the making.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.03,0:34:38.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便说  那也是互相打趣的一个好例子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was an example of breaking balls, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.29,0:34:47.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧孩子  起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, kid. Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.19,0:34:49.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.74,0:34:52.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should be ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.11,0:34:55.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烙铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.65,0:35:22.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold that for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.83,0:35:31.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.72,0:35:36.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来你们要看到的一幕比较难接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's about to happen is gonna be hard to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.67,0:35:39.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.99,0:35:42.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望能无视规矩  让这事过去算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could just ignore the rules and let it slide,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.77,0:35:44.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.39,0:35:47.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.04,0:35:50.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有规矩才能活命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rules keep us alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.76,0:35:55.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说  得  对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That...is...right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.04,0:35:59.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们活了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.20,0:36:02.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们保护他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We provide security to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.89,0:36:06.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们让世界重回文明\N{\fnArial\fs30}We bring civilization back to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.78,0:36:11.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.98,0:36:16.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但没有规矩  我们就做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can't do that without rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.50,0:36:20.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,规矩是一切运转的前提\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rules are what make it all work.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.58,0:36:23.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's not easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.65,0:36:25.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但总是有工作要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's always work.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.78,0:36:28.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都是有代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is always a cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.83,0:36:33.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里  如果你想逃避责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, if you try to skirt it,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.43,0:36:36.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想着偷工减料\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you try to cut that corner...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.51,0:36:46.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就要受烙铁之刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}...then it is the iron for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.12,0:36:56.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起立\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.98,0:37:12.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小德\N{\fnArial\fs30}D...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.38,0:37:34.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马克  抱歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mark...I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.00,0:37:38.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但规矩就是规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.52,0:38:24.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不是太糟糕  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, that wasn't so bad, now, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.37,0:38:32.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  他尿裤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus. He pissed himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.45,0:38:42.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打扫干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.42,0:38:51.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,医生  我完事了  你来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, I'm all done. Do your thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.70,0:39:00.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个孬种晕过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the pussy passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.31,0:39:03.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但事情解决了  我们两清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's settled -- we're square.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.63,0:39:06.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.74,0:39:10.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就让马克的脸每天提醒他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let Mark's face be a daily reminder to him
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.23,0:39:14.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,提醒所有人  规矩很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to everyone else that the rules matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.30,0:39:21.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望大家今天都学到了东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope that we all learned something today,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.71,0:39:23.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我再也不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I don't ever...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.48,0:39:26.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做这种事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}want to have to do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.22,0:39:37.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很疯狂是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some crazy shit, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.76,0:39:40.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可能会觉得我是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You probably think I'm a lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.09,0:39:41.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.78,0:39:44.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们想想怎么处理你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go figure out what to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.41,0:41:12.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[拉丁语]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.71,0:41:51.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想回到这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.16,0:41:52.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.11,0:42:01.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.19,0:42:06.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我请你帮我做一颗子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked you to make me a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.64,0:42:09.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你答应了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.99,0:42:11.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就给我做一颗子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}So make me a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.08,0:42:12.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我当时是答应了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. I said yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.88,0:42:15.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.49,0:42:17.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一时激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}was peak heat of the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.84,0:42:20.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在中间时刻  我深入思考了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, in the intervening hours, I've been taking a deep dive
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.67,0:42:22.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他选择和意外情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}into other options and contingencies,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.03,0:42:24.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要复盘找出\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to game out any iteration
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.75,0:42:28.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何开始这项行动的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}in which charging into this enterprise makes any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.68,0:42:33.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是想彻底阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not trying to definitively stop ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.81,0:42:36.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是想放慢你的节奏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just maybe slow your roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.22,0:42:40.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许先让你平静  营造某种安全感的错觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe go on for some lullin', false sense of security-wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.62,0:42:43.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不会等了  尤金  -那只是在犯傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not waiting, Eugene. -That's just being stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.54,0:42:45.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蠢货  你根本不知道自己在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pendejo, you don't know what the hell you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.82,0:42:47.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.90,0:42:50.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我彻底分析了局势\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've analyzed this top to bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.74,0:42:53.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你是偷袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter if you're stealthy,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.19,0:42:54.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狙击  用枪或者用刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}snipey, gun, or knifey.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.45,0:42:57.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚伯拉罕是对的  他们人多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham was right -- they have the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.58,0:43:00.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他占优势  想要对付他\N{\fnArial\fs30}His ballgame, unless we put together
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.01,0:43:01.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非我们集中人力  有人领导\N{\fnArial\fs30}a finishing move for a force of many,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.70,0:43:03.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,集中力量放大招\N{\fnArial\fs30}along with the man in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.69,0:43:04.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一颗子弹解决不了任何问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}A single bullet ain't gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.99,0:43:06.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好的情况下  也许你能打死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best case, maybe you take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.83,0:43:08.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就给我做一颗子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then make me a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.37,0:43:10.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人会付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody has to pay the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.57,0:43:14.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即便你情愿奉献自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you're willing...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.25,0:43:17.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就我们目前所知  牺牲的也不一定会是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}from all we've seen, it's not a lock you'll be the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.67,0:43:22.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我们救命恩人的人该不该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will the man who killed the man who saved our lives die?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.40,0:43:25.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-也许吧  -那就给我做颗子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe. - Then make me a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.27,0:43:28.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你劝服不了我  尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not talking me out of this, Eugene!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.35,0:43:30.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你欠我的  你也欠他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe me, and you owe him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.89,0:43:33.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有代价  我来承担\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if there's a price, I'll pay it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.43,0:43:36.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你不能告诉我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't you tell me no.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.41,0:43:39.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.85,0:43:42.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么都不做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.40,0:43:44.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.41,0:43:46.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个弱者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.25,0:43:49.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你之所以还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only reason you're alive
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.88,0:43:53.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为你撒谎  大家同情你\N{\fnArial\fs30}is because you lied and because people feel sorry for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.27,0:44:00.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  这一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, for once...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.65,0:44:04.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做点有用的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}do something useful...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.70,0:44:10.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我做颗子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and make me a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.62,0:45:06.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要怪自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't beat yourself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.58,0:45:08.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要怪自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.42,0:45:10.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He --
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.78,0:45:14.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他问了你马克和安珀的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked you about Mark and Amber,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.14,0:45:15.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你出卖了他们  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you sold 'em out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.14,0:45:19.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不得不这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.41,0:45:23.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.38,0:45:31.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你晚上能安睡就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever helps you sleep at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.62,0:45:41.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么睡得着\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you sleep at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.79,0:45:42.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.13,0:45:46.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看电视直到天明\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watch TV straight to the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.59,0:45:53.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我们跟他定下协议时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we made that deal with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.88,0:45:55.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我们做出的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was us deciding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.56,0:45:57.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那本该只影响到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was only supposed to affect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.28,0:45:58.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.17,0:46:00.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要你还站着\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're still standing,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.20,0:46:03.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是站在别人背上\N{\fnArial\fs30}then it's always on somebody else's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.20,0:46:12.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该走了  会被人看见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should go. Someone's going to see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.06,0:46:14.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.37,0:46:19.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我们没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.21,0:46:34.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能遮住脸了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I wrap up my face now?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.82,0:46:37.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  绝对不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you absolutely cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.11,0:46:38.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.19,0:46:42.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧这硬汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this badass.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.59,0:46:46.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行是因为我还没玩够你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't because I'm not done with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.44,0:46:49.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢看着你恶心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I like looking at your disgusting,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.54,0:46:53.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酷酷的  屌屌的眼睛  所以不准遮\N{\fnArial\fs30}rad-ass, badass eye, so it's staying out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.79,0:46:59.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.12,0:47:00.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有话说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got something to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.59,0:47:04.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why haven't you killed me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.65,0:47:06.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或我爸爸  或达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or my dad or Daryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.63,0:47:09.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.86,0:47:12.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会成为我的好战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}is gonna make a good soldier for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.87,0:47:16.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他以为自己扛得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, he thinks he's holding it together...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.34,0:47:18.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.60,0:47:20.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.36,0:47:23.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经开始给我好东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's already getting me great stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.67,0:47:26.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至于你嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, on the other hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.62,0:47:32.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走着瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we shall see.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.18,0:47:36.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,击溃你更有成效\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more productive to break you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.85,0:47:39.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也更有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}More fun, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.32,0:47:43.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这很蠢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thinking that's stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.23,0:47:44.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking we're different.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.04,0:47:51.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个聪明孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a smart kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.14,0:47:54.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为我该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think I should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.30,0:47:57.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我不能放走你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I can't let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.87,0:48:00.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  我该杀了你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, do I kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.46,0:48:03.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烫你的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iron your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.39,0:48:04.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,砍掉你的胳膊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chop off your arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.84,0:48:06.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.59,0:48:08.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.79,0:48:12.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你该跳窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you should jump out the window
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.18,0:48:14.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,省下我杀你的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}to save me the trouble of killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.53,0:48:25.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这才是那个让我印象深刻的小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, there is the kid that impressed the hell out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.46,0:48:29.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为你不说你要对我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're not saying what you're gonna do to me
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.03,0:48:30.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为你什么都不会做\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you're not going to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.63,0:48:34.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你了解我们  如果你了解那些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you knew us, if you knew anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.26,0:48:36.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会杀了我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you would kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.80,0:48:39.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.82,0:48:45.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.44,0:48:48.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.38,0:48:55.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去兜兜风  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go for a ride, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.37,0:49:19.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.90,0:49:26.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来很担心  所以我要带这孩子回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem worried, so I'm taking the kid home.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.43,0:49:28.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你敢对他做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do anything to him --
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.67,0:49:29.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dwight!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.60,0:49:32.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔需要静静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl needs a time-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.95,0:49:35.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他进小屋里待待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put him back in his box for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.92,0:50:42.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(趁现在快走)
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.05,0:51:43.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.67,0:51:50.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有你的刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your knife, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.23,0:51:57.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢  你要我的鞋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What next? You want my shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.01,0:52:02.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带我去找尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me to Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.29,0:52:19.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发动  我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start it up. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.89,0:52:54.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带我...去找尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me...to Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.95,0:53:10.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-卡尔  在哪...  -伊妮德没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carl, where's -- - Enid's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.70,0:53:13.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  很好  很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, great, great, great, great, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.93,0:53:16.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.37,0:53:17.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I --
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.67,0:53:20.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我只是...  -不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm just -- - Don't care
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.54,0:53:21.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.64,0:53:26.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出去给你找补给了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, out scavenging for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.83,0:53:27.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.04,0:53:29.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会等\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.67,0:53:33.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他去的地方很远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um...he went out pretty far.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.67,0:53:35.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们今天也许回不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They might not be back today.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.81,0:53:38.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一切物资都很缺\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're running really low on everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.04,0:53:41.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们差不多要饿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're practically starving here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.61,0:53:45.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饿死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starving?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.10,0:53:48.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.80,0:53:52.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"差不多"指的是"还没有"吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}By "Practically," You mean "Not really."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.56,0:54:04.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.20,0:54:09.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些人真是没幽默感\N{\fnArial\fs30}You people seriously don't have a sense of humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.35,0:54:17.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.80,0:54:22.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.40,0:54:24.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥利维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.13,0:54:27.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.61,0:54:28.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥利维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.13,0:54:43.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉刚才对你无礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry for having been so rude to you just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.87,0:54:46.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来我要在这里待一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it looks like I'm gonna be here for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.00,0:54:48.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等待你们无畏的领袖归来\N{\fnArial\fs30}awaiting your fearless leader's return.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.77,0:54:51.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you'd like...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.86,0:54:55.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得让我干你一炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it would be enjoyable...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.79,0:54:57.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定会很享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}to screw your brains out.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.01,0:55:01.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  如果你同意的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if, you know, you're agreeable to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.60,0:55:18.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对你的喜欢又增加了50%\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am about 50% more into you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.39,0:55:21.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just sayin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.91,0:55:31.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我要把脚翘起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, I'm just gonna put my feet up
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.51,0:55:33.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着我的东西抵达这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wait for my stuff to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.10,0:55:36.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥利维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olivia...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.50,0:55:40.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能做个乖孩子  给我们冲点柠檬水吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}would you be a lamb and make us a little lemonade?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.22,0:55:43.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我给你们留了一些粉类的好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I know I left you all some of that good powdered stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.04,0:55:44.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我应该要去...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm supposed to be with --
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.44,0:55:45.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去冲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.82,0:55:51.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去冲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.80,0:55:53.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.34,0:55:55.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冲好点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it good.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.94,0:56:08.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.49,0:56:10.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带我参观吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me on the grand tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.89,0:56:35.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个房间呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.20,0:56:36.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个热水器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I-it's just a water heater --
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.66,0:56:38.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是认真的吗  孩子  拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious, kid? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.24,0:56:45.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh-ho, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.73,0:56:53.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看这个小天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this little angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.18,0:57:39.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.45,0:57:36.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙  他有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy -- he's armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.02,0:57:39.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,食物  补给  弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has food, supplies, ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.62,0:57:51.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"如果你看到这里还没中枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The only way that you have possibly read this far
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.16,0:57:54.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只可能是我死了"\N{\fnArial\fs30}without being shot is that I am dead."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.41,0:58:17.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来他保护了自己的补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like he protected his supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.37,0:58:20.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来补给依然被保护着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like they're still protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.33,0:58:24.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有今天  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today and only today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.33,0:58:29.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.50,0:58:49.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.73,0:58:55.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对我说过的话道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.00,0:58:56.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我拒绝接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I reject that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.58,0:58:57.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.96,0:58:58.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.31,0:59:02.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘴上道歉  心里没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the words, but not the intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.19,0:59:06.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你语气很真诚  但只是在耍猴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound sincere, but it's just a flea circus.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.98,0:59:08.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得到了想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.47,0:59:09.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不过是你感到内疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just you feeling bad
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.47,0:59:11.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不代表你说的不是真心话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not saying that you didn't mean what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.65,0:59:13.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是真心的  你是那样想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You meant it, you felt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.11,0:59:14.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.33,0:59:16.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.98,0:59:19.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在想回到尴尬的沉默中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to take it back to awkward silence now.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.40,0:59:39.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到想要的东西了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find what you wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.73,0:59:40.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.56,0:59:44.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.01,0:59:52.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是从哪里找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you acquire all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.85,0:59:57.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉丁语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Latin.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.34,0:59:59.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是门痛苦难熬的课\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a pain-in-the-ass class.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.26,1:00:03.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妈妈说那痛苦总有一天会有回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom said that pain would be useful someday.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.87,1:00:06.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是一个有计划的死人的贮藏清单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a list of caches from a dead guy with a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.04,1:00:10.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我挖出了医药用品  净水器  照明弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dug up medical supplies, water purifiers, flares...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.95,1:00:12.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你会全部都给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're just gonna give it all to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.54,1:00:16.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是瑞克要我们做的  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what Rick wants us to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.02,1:00:20.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我会这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's what I'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.46,1:00:22.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还会做更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna do more than that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.76,1:00:47.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.92,1:00:50.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.01,1:00:56.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小姑娘真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this little girl is precious.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.39,1:01:01.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  邻居\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.85,1:01:04.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚点过来做客吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you come by later?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.25,1:01:05.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也许会烧烤\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might grill out.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.85,1:01:10.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I like it here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.11,1:01:16.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定我会住下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might just have to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.97,1:01:21.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想你之前说的话  卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I was thinking about what you said earlier, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.51,1:01:28.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许让你和你爸爸活着是很蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it is stupid keeping you and your dad alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.89,1:01:32.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我何必这么努力呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, why am I trying so hard?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.31,1:01:38.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我应该把你们俩埋在某个花坛里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I should just bury you both down in one of those flower beds.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.80,1:01:45.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后自己住在这近郊住宅区里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I could just settle into the suburbs.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.29,1:01:47.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think about that?
